      "en": "Ruby Life Pools Nerfs on Patch 12.1.5 PTR - Mythic+ Dungeon Tuning",
      "es": "Ruby Life Pools Nerfs en el parche 12.1.5 PTR - Mítica+ Mazmorra Tuning"
